msgid ""
"`XBStation <https://xbstation.com>`__ Kit is a plug and play hardware to "
"transmites drone data and videos to ground stations or monitoring centers "
"for BVLOS remote operations based on real-time 4G LTE connectivity."
msgstr ""
"`XBStation <https://xbstation.com>`__ 套件是一种即插即用硬件，基于实时 4G LTE "
"连接，把无人机数据和视频传输到地面站或监控中心，用于超视距（BVLOS）远程作业。"

